{"page_content": "R.7.8.8 Information requirements for toxicity to sediment organisms\n\nThe information requirements for sediment toxicity are described by REACH Annexes VII to XI, that specify the information that shall be submitted for registration and evaluation purposes.\n\nFor this endpoint information requirements are formulated for substances produced or imported in quantities of \u22651000 t/y (Annex X to REACH).", "metadata": {"doc_id": "184ed393-a937-426a-b387-32cbfe51a970", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7b_en.pdf"}}